*   `torque`: The 640i produces 330 lb-ft of torque (Source [9], [10], [20], [30]) or 450 Nm (332 lb-ft) (Source [2], [7], [19], [25]). These figures are well above the 190 lb-ft average. Using 330 lb-ft for scoring.
